OL,3,GNEWSAScouts say they face #1m tourist  
OL,4,Atax cost for overnight trips           
OL,6,FScout groups are warning they could    
OL,7,Fface an additional annual bill of #1m  
OL,8,Fas a result of the government's        
OL,9,Fproposed tourist tax for England.      
OL,11,FThe overnight levy would allow councils
OL,12,Fand regional authorities to charge     
OL,13,Fvisitors an additional fee for their   
OL,14,Faccommodation, including campsites,    
OL,15,Fraising money to be spent on local     
OL,16,Fservices.                              
OL,18,FThe increased cost from the Visitors   
OL,19,FLevy could price some young people out 
OL,20,Fof joining Scout camps and other trips,
OL,21,Fthe group said.                        
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
