OL,3,GNEWSAScouts say they face #1m tourist  
OL,4,Atax cost for overnight trips           
OL,6,FDwayne Fields, the UK's Chief Scout,   
OL,7,Fhas called for youth groups to be      
OL,8,Fexempted and said the charity - which  
OL,9,Fsees more than 1.4m overnight stays a  
OL,10,Fyear - would be "firmly opposed to any 
OL,11,Fproposal that would see local mayors   
OL,12,Ftax Scouts and other voluntary youth   
OL,13,Forganisations".                        
